From 5f5a34da6ac52609462f73016a2d279f7bdaae9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 06:58:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] test: declare the tests' requirements with `requires`

New contrib/devtools/declarative-test-requires.py replaces a
skip_test_if_missing_module() override that only calls skip_if_*()
helpers with the equivalent `requires = {...}`. 113 tests converted.
Three overrides check other conditions and stay
(feature_bind_port_discover.py, feature_bind_port_externalip.py,
feature_dirsymlinks.py).

Every converted module imports, and the full functional suite gives the
same per-test results as before.
---
